flowchart LR
  %% Belenios; Specification 3.0, homomorphic mode with Pedersen trustees
  %% Evidence: https://www.belenios.org/specification.pdf
  S1["Initialization<br/>Configure Pedersen trustee key"]
  S2["Registration<br/>Issue credentials and voter weights"]
  S1 --> S2
  S3["Ballot generation<br/>Encrypt, prove validity, sign ballot"]
  S2 --> S3
  S4["Validation and accumulation<br/>Verify; retain latest credential ballot"]
  S3 --> S4
  S5["Final tally<br/>Trustees verify data; decrypt aggregate"]
  S4 --> S5
  S6["Disclosure<br/>Publish result and partial decryptions"]
  S5 --> S6
  %% Execution: Voting server and public hash-chain archive.
  %% Keys: Configured trustees.
  %% Full tally: Public in selected mode.
  %% Public checks: Recompute retained-set tally; verify proofs.
